title: overriding another atom
pid: 26ad12bb-3991-467f-9f93-f10dc9df0210
body: |2-
  When unfolding a view (which could begin at an overridee),
  replace the overridee of
    ( any links target,
      and any content in a contains relationship ),
  with the corresponding overrider.
  This is safe, presumably, when the user subscribes to the overridee.
